# SideChainer repository — ignore rules
# Baseline created 2026-10-08 after the new-Mac migration restore.
#
# IMPORTANT: release evidence under
#   SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/
# is intentionally TRACKED (FINAL pkg/dmg, candidate trees, notarization
# receipts, validation logs). Do not add blanket ignores for build/ or *.log.

# --- macOS noise ---
.DS_Store

# --- Xcode build output / caches (disposable, regenerated) ---
# Main project: keep release-assets, ignore every other build/ child
# (Debug, Release, *.build, XCBuildData, caches, future output).
SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/*
!SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/

# Phase 1 SidechainBusTest: keep the .xcodeproj/plists, drop build output
Phase1-SidechainBusTest/Builds/MacOSX/build/
# ...and the compiled host-test binary (AUHostTest.mm is the source)
Phase1-SidechainBusTest/HostTest/AUHostTest

# Windows handoff snapshot: no build output present now; guard against future
Windows-Build-Transfer/**/Builds/MacOSX/build/

# Generic Xcode artifacts anywhere
**/DerivedData*/
**/BuiltProducts/
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
**/XCBuildData/
**/*.build/

# --- Packaging staging (rebuildable from the FINAL pkg) ---
SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/**/package-root*/
SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/**/pkgroot-rebuild/
SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/**/dmg-root/
SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/**/dmg-final-staging/
SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/**/package-build-final-tmp/
SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/**/package-input/
SideChain/Builds/MacOSX/build/release-assets/**/dmg-payload/

# --- Test build products (regenerated by Tests/*.sh) ---
Tests/*.o
Tests/*.dSYM
Tests/compile.log
Tests/ui_compile.log
Tests/DSPRegressionTests
Tests/Phase4Tests
Tests/Phase5TimingTests
Tests/Phase6Tests
Tests/Phase8Tests
Tests/PresetTests
Tests/DuckLengthTests
Tests/BeatSchedulerTests
Tests/TriggerDSPTests
Tests/DetectorTests
Tests/UIVerifyHarness
Tests/HostProbeAU
Tests/LogicFidelityProbe
Tests/CPUBench
HostCheck/VST3BusCheck
